== status, with one written and one open Goal
G-ID  written  runs: 0 of 3 used
stop: none
waits: grill
owner may:
  hyp add goal G-ID --base <commit> --words <words> --line <kind>:<text>
grill may:
  hyp place G-ID line-1/<example>
  hyp place G-ID line-2/<example>
probe-writer may:
  (none)
runner may:
  (none)
G-ID  open  runs: 0 of 3 used
stop: none
waits: none
owner may:
  (none)
grill may:
  hyp place G-ID line-1/<example>
  hyp place G-ID line-2/<example>
probe-writer may:
  (none)
runner may:
  hyp run <commit> G-ID/line-1
  hyp run <commit> G-ID/line-2